( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-farmers-ox )

Adventurer,

As the lands get warmer and the days get longer, it=E2=80=99s time to sow y=
our seeds. Luckily, a new *Referral Season* has begun, and until June 1 you=
 can get your very own *Farmer=E2=80=99s Ox* ( https://albiononline.com/new=
s/referral-farmers-ox ) mount skin for your Transport Ox base mount when yo=
u refer a friend!

This *brand-new mount* *skin* brings to life a well-known image from Albion=
=E2=80=99s past - the sturdy ox with a lantern hanging from its horns, crat=
es heaving with wares, and a carrot dangling in front of it. Once you=E2=80=
=99ve unlocked this skin, it can be used by *all characters* on your accoun=
t - so any of them can enjoy the company of this dependable beast.

And as always, there are further rewards on offer for your third and fifth =
referrals. The current referral season lasts until maintenance on *June 1* =
, so you've got until then to refer your friends and claim your rewards!

( https://albiononline.com/news/rites-of-spring-coming )

Springtime Surprises
--------------------

*April 12* marks the beginning of the *Rites of Spring* in Albion, with dec=
orations in the cities and themed items for you to hunt down. And in additi=
on, rumor has it that a *brand-new, special reward* will be appearing throu=
ghout the open world=E2=80=A6

One thing=E2=80=99s for certain: there=E2=80=99s going to be a frenzy acros=
s the lands as rival parties fight over the *abundant treasures* to be foun=
d throughout the open world. The Rites of Spring begins on Tuesday, April 1=
2, and runs until Tuesday, April 26. Make sure not to miss out on the excit=
ement!

( https://albiononline.com/news/hunter-challenge-2022 )

The Hunter Challenge is Underway
--------------------------------

The hunt is on! For the month of April, take the *Hunter Challenge* : earn =
points for open-world activities, unlock chests to get valuable loot, and c=
laim your very own *Black Panther* , a sleek feline mount with a fearsome a=
ppearance and a powerful *speed boost* spell.

You can earn Challenge Points by *gathering, fishing, farming* , and *killi=
ng monsters*. Points count simultaneously toward a daily bonus, a weekly un=
lockable chest, and the monthly mount. So log in, head out into the open wo=
rld, gather points, and claim your rewards!

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/hunter-challenge-2022 )

